## Web demo defaults

```
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# Optional corpus deep links for citation tiles
VITE_DOCUMENTS_PUBLIC_BASE=https://demo-host.example/files
# Skip Spline bundle — book emoji only (slow networks / pilot table demos)
# VITE_LITE_DEMO=true
#
# Mount the real Spline scene (WebGL). Leave unset for SVG-book avatar — some GPUs lose the
# whole tab (~1s after opening the modal) when Spline loads; set only when testing the .splinecode asset.
# VITE_ENABLE_SPLINE=true
```

Copy to `.env.local` (ignored from git).
